  "metadata": {
    "title": "Machines, Typists, and Output-Rate Work Problems",
    "description": "Use pages/hour, units/minute, or batches/hour as work rates.",
    "teachingApproach": "Transfer the chapter's work-rate logic into visible production units. Begin with pages per hour and tonnes per minute, then combine machines, recover a hidden machine, split output so workers finish together, and handle symbolic machine counts. Units stay explicit on every step so unlike rates are never added accidentally.",
