    "sourceScope": "R.S. Aggarwal, Quantitative Aptitude for Competitive Examinations, Chapter 17, Time and Work. Approved scope: Transfer time-and-work reasoning to output rates. Cover pages per hour, machines producing a fixed batch, conveyor throughput, combined production, a hidden machine rate from a target together-time, splitting work between typists so they finish together, and symbolic production rates such as p machines each making q units in r minutes. Keep units explicit and add rates only after converting them to the same output-per-time unit."
  },
